  "goodToKnow": "Die Tochtergesellschaft is a subsidiary, controlled by a Muttergesellschaft (parent company); together they form a Konzern. In business news, both are often shortened: die Konzernmutter, die Bahn-Tochter DB Cargo. Volkswagen, for example, owns Audi, Porsche and Škoda. An Enkelgesellschaft (granddaughter company) is a subsidiary of a subsidiary. Plural: die Tochtergesellschaften."
